        "description": "Requires world_write, storage_v2 and active exact wallet. Fixed effective contract from purchase or accepted supplement; ceil(full_price * damage / max_condition) at 0.0001 Cr, ceil each raw material to whole units. Building budget pays original settlement treasury. Personal balance unchanged. Materials only from accessible backpack slots. Only own ready/paused/damaged buildings with own rooms and no construction/shelter/nested estate. Destroyed/archived buildings cannot be repaired. Damaged or stopped buildings remain paused; no lodging restored. Healthy active lodging is preserved. All transfers, consumption, condition, revisions, audit and outbox share a transaction; same key replays original result.",
